  "slug": "kissed-gooey-japanese-pork-shio-ramen",
  "title": "Tonkotsu Ramen",
  "description": "A Japanese-inspired, rich and creamy pork broth ramen dish. The combination of pork slices, boiled egg, and vegetables makes for a satisfying meal.",
