  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large pot, combine pork bones, shio koji, and 4 cups of water.",
    "2. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to 180°F (82°C) and simmer for 4 hours.",
    "3. Strain the broth and discard the solids.",
    "4. Cook ramen noodles according to package instructions.",
    "5. In a pan, cook sliced pork over medium heat until browned.",
    "6. Add sliced onion and minced garlic to the pan and cook until softened.",
    "7. Add cooked noodles to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "8. Ladle the hot broth over the noodles and pork.",
    "9. Top with boiled egg, green onion, and sliced scallions.",
    "10. Garnish with sliced pork fat."
  ],
